&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an exceptional Accountant with IFRS experience to help us ready the business for public market scrutiny through our planned IPO.&amp;nbsp; The right candidate will have domain expertise and a passion for IFRS.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
