&lt;li&gt;Support the finance team&#39;s wider plans to prepare for an IPO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the efficiency of financial processes and procedures and monitor compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge between team members to ensure cover is available when needed&lt;/li&gt;
